  metadata, failure/fallback tests, and benchmark samples for claimed speedups.
- Active foundation: integer-only CUDA kernels implement exact classic
  rotate/crazy batches through NVRTC + Driver API behind the shared accelerator
  port. CUDA 13.3 Update 1 redistributables are reproducibly pinned by component
  path/version/SHA-256; the active Python adapter uses standard-library `ctypes`
  only.
- Compact classic one-step VM execution is now active. A fixed-width request
  declares registers/counters/input plus at most four keyed memory cells; CUDA
  returns the full `StepTrace`-equivalent projection. Compact, resident classic,
