  members before protocol encoding or CUDA work. Hardware-neutral primitive
  batches now also require the exact kind enum and immutable tuple arrays.
  Primitive candidate bridges validate exact kind, adapter call surface, and

  immutable capability identity during construction. Ordinary and prepared
  outputs require an exact primitive result record before capability or payload
